  "version": 1,
  "title": "Erdős Problem 593: classification of obligatory triple systems",
  "abstract": "A Lean 4 formalization of the finite classification of obligatory triple systems. For every finite edge-indexed simple 3-uniform hypergraph F, the compared theorem proves that F is obligatory if and only if its isolated-point reduction is linear, every hyperedge-node of its Levi graph is incident with a bridge, and every Berge cycle has even length.",
